msgstr "高擎 Panthera HT 描述（`panthera_ht`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:15
#: 54304ed152f14b36b35d6321d6528986
msgid ""
"Two launch processes: one `master`, one `slave` (mock or two physical "
"arms)"
msgstr "两个启动进程：一个 `master`、一个 `slave`（mock 或两台实体臂）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:17
#: 358661b15b1941cc9af7af7347abece9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:19
#: 7d22497f08a948e0aef93c659db2755d
msgid "One controller plugin, two roles:"
msgstr "同一个控制器插件，两种角色："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: c1aed41c5fd3488eaf874d48a63d1bc6
msgid "Role"
msgstr "角色"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: 5ff3de726bca4dc18b7e077325e6a275
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: dd2d3503a4474a79aa7176ce22cc0ef9
msgid "`master`"
msgstr "`master`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: a2ae65049d364b7db3c4b49750ff4500
msgid ""
"Operator side. Gravity compensation so you can move the arm in joint "
"space; publishes mapped joint state."
msgstr "操作者侧。重力补偿，便于在关节空间移动主臂；发布映射后的关节状态。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: 8ee955d8bf874b5692271f44c84171ad
msgid "`slave`"
msgstr "`slave`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md
#: 69f12007241a4b238dd62afe2592b776
msgid "Follower. Tracks the mapped master joints (optional ruckig smoothing)."
msgstr "从臂。跟踪映射后的主臂关节（可选 ruckig 平滑）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:26
#: fa319dd14b3c43f3839ad2922253b95e
msgid ""
"Control modes (`mode`): `position` (slave only), `mit`, `effort`. Master-"
"only force feedback (`feedback`): `false`, `position`, `effort`. Joint "
"mapping runs before `teleop_states` is published. Grippers are handled by"
" `adaptive_gripper_controller` (spawned from the same launch)."
msgstr ""
"控制模式（`mode`）：`position`（仅从臂）、`mit`、`effort`。仅主臂的力反馈（`feedback`）：`false`、`position`、`effort`。关节映射在发布"
" `teleop_states` 之前完成。夹爪由同一 launch 拉起的 `adaptive_gripper_controller` 控制。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:28
#: 56da3d960ddf405abae38449afb17f95
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "准备"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:30
#: 9feb3b5d8ce74a0cb2b999c46b7ce793
msgid ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-select drag_teleop_controller --symlink-install\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws\n"
"colcon build --packages-select drag_teleop_controller --symlink-install\n"
"source install/setup.bash\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:36
#: 9baf8cde228e49e7b55e1d7c6622e202
msgid "Mock (no hardware)"
msgstr "Mock（无需硬件）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:38
#: 7a2111a75adb458c99b6f0a3a3bcd668
msgid "Two terminals:"
msgstr "两个终端："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:40
#: bfa5a161791141ee9abd55e26f96cab5
msgid ""
"# Terminal 1 — master\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"\n"
"# Terminal 2 — slave\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"
msgstr ""
"# Terminal 1 — master\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=mock_components\n"
"\n"
"# Terminal 2 — slave\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=mock_components\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:50
#: 865b7eb2f8014a53950128624868b076
msgid "Check controllers and topics:"
msgstr "检查控制器与话题："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:52
#: 8e9a8a281212461fb578902b85b3d65b
msgid ""
"ros2 control list_controllers --controller-manager "
"/drag_teleop_master/controller_manager\n"
"# drag_teleop_controller / left_gripper_controller / "
"right_gripper_controller should be active\n"
"\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_master/teleop_states\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_slave/teleop_states\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 control list_controllers --controller-manager "
"/drag_teleop_master/controller_manager\n"
"# drag_teleop_controller / left_gripper_controller / "
"right_gripper_controller should be active\n"
"\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_master/teleop_states\n"
"ros2 topic echo /drag_teleop_slave/teleop_states\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:60
#: cd645e669967445b963f17a831340fcf
msgid "Real hardware (HighTorque Panthera HT)"
msgstr "真机（高擎 Panthera HT）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:62
#: 72a6990c8d5c46b8a2beb0f1aa5050fa
msgid ""
"Prefer `./teleop_start.sh` on the `panthera-ht` branch. Launch file and "
"argument names below match the package README. Default `robot` is "
"`panthera_ht`. Use `hardware:=real` (or `real_usb`)."
msgstr ""
"在 `panthera-ht` 分支上优先使用 `./teleop_start.sh`。下列 launch 文件与参数名与软件包 README "
"一致。默认 `robot` 为 `panthera_ht`。真机用 `hardware:=real`（或 `real_usb`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:64
#: c87dd58f87954a3d99d8a5e1fd2e2a47
msgid ""
"# Master (low-stiffness, gravity-compensated)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=real mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_control_mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_gripper_kp:=\"1e-5\" hardware_gripper_kd:=\"1e-5\"\n"
"\n"
"# Slave (MIT follow)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=real mode:=mit\n"
msgstr ""
"# Master (low-stiffness, gravity-compensated)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=master hardware:=real mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_control_mode:=effort \\\n"
"  hardware_gripper_kp:=\"1e-5\" hardware_gripper_kd:=\"1e-5\"\n"
"\n"
"# Slave (MIT follow)\n"
"ros2 launch drag_teleop_controller drag_teleop_controller.launch.py \\\n"
"  role:=slave hardware:=real mode:=mit\n"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:76
#: 3eec8b851b9a4acbbe807fa252cbd608
msgid ""
"Optional master with external-effort feedback: add `feedback:=effort` "
"(see README)."
msgstr "可选：主臂加外部力矩反馈，增加 `feedback:=effort`（见 README）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:78
#: b93134378a57421f88403ef2bd225481
msgid "Mode switching"
msgstr "模式切换"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:80
#: db4371fe9a3e4398bb03e89a08da4cee
msgid "Custom services, not `std_srvs/Trigger`:"
msgstr "自定义服务，不是 `std_srvs/Trigger`："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:82
#: 9feada7751f54f2eb5d75ec2a935d887
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_mode \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopMode \"{mode: effort}\"\n"
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_feedback \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopFeedback \"{mode: position}\"\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_mode \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopMode \"{mode: effort}\"\n"
"ros2 service call /drag_teleop_master/teleop_feedback \\\n"
"  drag_teleop_controller/srv/TeleopFeedback \"{mode: position}\"\n"

